WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.156
Mom: What's your idea, Sam?

2
00:00:04.155 --> 00:00:06.867
Sam: Grandpa's birthday is coming.

3
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:09.872
Let's have a surprise party!

4
00:00:09.872 --> 00:00:13.667
Mom: Oh! That is a great idea!

5
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:17.728
Let's see. We can invite the Doyles and— Sam:

6
00:00:17.728 --> 00:00:20.135
Don't forget Lucky! Mom:

7
00:00:20.135 --> 00:00:24.338
I won't. He's one of Grandpa's best friends!

8
00:00:24.338 --> 00:00:27.672
Grandma Ruby: Who's one of Grandpa's best friends?

9
00:00:27.672 --> 00:00:31.670
Sam: Lucky. Grandma Ruby, guess what?

10
00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:36.018
We're having a surprise party for Grandpa!

11
00:00:36.019 --> 00:00:39.985
Grandma Ruby: Great idea! Who thought of it?

12
00:00:39.986 --> 00:00:42.201
Sam: Me.

13
00:00:42.201 --> 00:00:47.275
Mom: Let's make a list. We need snacks, cake . .

14
00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:52.276
. Grandma Ruby: Ice cream . . . balloons . .

15
00:00:52.276 --> 00:00:58.936
. Sam: Don't forget presents! He's turning

16
00:00:58.936 --> 00:01:05.616
seventy! Grandma Ruby: Right. It's a

17
00:01:05.616 --> 00:01:09.501
big birthday— Grandpa Bill: What's

18
00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:12.470
going on? Do you three have a secret?

19
00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:15.151
Sam: Us? No! I mean—

20
00:01:15.152 --> 00:01:18.004
Lilly:

21
00:01:18.004 --> 00:01:22.204
Oooo! Mmm-mmm-mmm . . .

22
00:01:22.204 --> 00:01:27.872
Grandpa Bill: Lilly! No, honey!

23
00:01:27.872 --> 00:01:33.255
Sam: Whew!

